  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 301.03 Evidence of Experience. The candidate shall submit certified documentation of satisfactory completion of one year of experience as administrator-in-training (AIT) in a nursing home of at least 50 beds or equivalent experience as described in Nuh 306.01.\n\nSource. #1393, eff 7-1-79; ss by #2224, eff 1-1-83; ss by #2922, eff 12-10-84, EXPIRED: 12-10-90\n\nNew. #5097, eff 3-18-91; ss by #5326, eff 2-13-92, EXPIRED: 2-13-98\n\nNew. #7663, eff 3-19-02, EXPIRED: 3-19-10\n\nNew. #9830-A, eff 12-10-10, EXPIRED: 12-10-18; ss by #12690, eff 12-19-18",
